cluding sundries, dry grocery, candy, cooler, freezer, deli, liquor, and tobacco) \u0026#8226; Non-Foods (including major appliances, small electronics, health and beauty aids, hardware, lawn and garden, sporting goods, tires, toys and seaso\",\r\n  \"y less than other broadline retailers. We average anywhere from 9,000 to 10,000 SKUs online, some of which are available in our warehouses. Many consumable products are offered for sale in case, carton, or multiple-pack quantities only. To promote member satisfaction, we generally accept returns of merchandise. On certain electronic items, we typically have a 90-day return policy and provide, free of charge, technical support services, as well as an extended warranty. Additional third-party warranty coverage is sold on certain electronic items. We offer merchandise and services in the following categories: \u0026#9632; Core Merchandise Categories (or core business): \u0026#8226; Foods and Sundries (including sundries, dry grocery, candy, cooler, freezer, deli, liquor, and tobacco) \u0026#8226; Non-Foods (including major appliances, small electronics, health and beauty aids, hardware, lawn and garden, sporting goods, tires, toys and seasonal, office supplies, automotive, stamps, tickets, apparel, furniture, domestics, housewares, special order kiosk, and jewelry) \u0026#8226; Fresh Fo\"\r\n]\r\n"}}}
